usage: client.py [-h] -i HOSTNAME -p PORT [-n NAME]

Connect Four client.

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
  -i HOSTNAME  server hostname (looked up with DNS) or IP
  -p PORT      server port (1024-65535)
  -n NAME      your player name (optional, asks if missing)

examples:
  python3 client.py -i server.kuykendall.edu -p 8080
  python3 client.py -i localhost -p 8080 -n PowderDay
(exit code 0)

